<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28628" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠσ-ᾱής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ill-blowing, stormy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέμοιο δυσαέος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.865
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεφύροιο δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.200
				</span></i>
			, al.: poet. gen. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσαήων</span>
			for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσαέων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.99
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>excessive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κρυμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Dian.</u>
					115
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					13.134
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.739
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Phaedim.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ill-smelling</i>, of a seal, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.114
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>H.</u>
					4.662
				</span></i>
			.</div>
